          "id": 1649188721,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "QFileDialog normally does use the native platform file dialog-- except that we intentionally `setOption(QFileDialog::DontUseNativeDialog, true);` because the \"use the native platform dialog\" doesn't play well with adding custom widgets, like our \"Packet Range\" box.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
